    "regime_notes": "Weak in 2020-2023 (IC -0.03808, ICIR -0.10682) but robustly positive from 2024 onward: 2024-2026 IC +0.06935 / ICIR +0.20200, 2027-2029 +0.05640 / +0.19150, 2030-2032 +0.06358 / +0.22391, and 2033-2034 +0.07178 / +0.29312. Interpret conservatively because the cross-section is 15 assets and regimes are not independent.",
